{"url": "（本地文件）024、第二十二节：用 before after when理清事件顺序.mp4", "link": false, "lang": "zh", "local_path": "G:\\【瑞杰老师】全能英语课程\\瑞杰老师 30 天英语实战训练营(1)\\024、第二十二节：用 before after when理清事件顺序.mp4", "segments": [{"start": 12.12, "text": "我们在21节课的时候到了clothing store去,那我们做了一件什么事情?", "end": 39.86}, {"start": 39.86, "text": "那借此机会也祝大家双蛋快乐!", "end": 42.86}, {"start": 43.86, "text": "I wish you a merry christmas and a happy new year!", "end": 49.86}, {"start": 49.86, "text": "学会多祝福语,这两句话在双蛋这期间是非常高频的祝福语,四处都会看到。", "end": 59.86}, {"start": 59.86, "text": "Merry christmas and a happy new year!", "end": 62.86}, {"start": 62.86, "text": "Merry christmas,美好的圣诞和Happy new year,快乐的新年。", "end": 67.86}, {"start": 67.86, "text": "那当然这是国际年,中国新年,Happy Chinese New Year,这个是后面的。", "end": 73.86}, {"start": 73.86, "text": "So that is how we greet,这是我们打招呼的方式。", "end": 78.3}, {"start": 78.3, "text": "Let's go into lesson 22 and see what happens.", "end": 82.3}, {"start": 82.3, "text": "今天我们的阅读有所发展,我们看一下新的剧情。", "end": 86.3}, {"start": 86.3, "text": "This is a tree,tree这个单词频率之高,基本上是非常好记的。", "end": 93.3}, {"start": 94.3, "text": "Tree,tree,tree,this is a tree.", "end": 97.3}, {"start": 97.3, "text": "This is a branch.", "end": 99.86}, {"start": 99.86, "text": "树上有很多的什么?branch,这些树枝叫做branch,of the tree.", "end": 106.86}, {"start": 106.86, "text": "This is a branch of the tree.", "end": 109.86}, {"start": 109.86, "text": "所以是它的一部分,a branch of a tree,注意of的运用。", "end": 116.32}, {"start": 116.32, "text": "An apple is on this branch,there is an apple.", "end": 121.32}, {"start": 121.32, "text": "注意apple用an apple,为什么?", "end": 125.32}, {"start": 125.32, "text": "一般来说是a apple,一个苹果对吧,或者某个苹果。", "end": 130.32}, {"start": 130.32, "text": "这时候不特指,就是随机的苹果。", "end": 133.32}, {"start": 133.32, "text": "因为apple这个词的首字母是a,所以它会说什么?", "end": 138.32}, {"start": 138.32, "text": "An apple,它会做一个收音的动作。", "end": 142.32}, {"start": 142.32, "text": "如果不是原音的aeiou这些开口的音的字母的话,就无需做这个an的处理。", "end": 150.32}, {"start": 150.32, "text": "比如说e就好了。", "end": 152.32}, {"start": 152.32, "text": "所以an apple,注意这个贯词。", "end": 155.75}, {"start": 155.25, "text": "是在这个瓶子上。", "end": 157.25}, {"start": 157.25, "text": "这个苹果是在这个瓶子上。", "end": 160.25}, {"start": 160.25, "text": "它是在女孩的头上。", "end": 163.25}, {"start": 163.25, "text": "这是一个女孩。", "end": 165.25}, {"start": 165.25, "text": "这是她的头。", "end": 166.25}, {"start": 166.25, "text": "它是在她的头上。", "end": 168.25}, {"start": 168.25, "text": "这是一个苹果。", "end": 170.25}, {"start": 170.25, "text": "在她的头上。", "end": 171.25}, {"start": 171.25, "text": "它是在女孩的头上。", "end": 174.25}, {"start": 174.25, "text": "她会从瓶子上取出苹果。", "end": 178.25}, {"start": 178.25, "text": "她会从瓶子上取出苹果。", "end": 183.25}, {"start": 182.97, "text": "注意from的运用。", "end": 184.97}, {"start": 195.6, "text": "所以要去拿这个苹果,它干嘛?", "end": 197.6}, {"start": 202.6, "text": "故事进一步发展。", "end": 204.6}, {"start": 204.6, "text": "所以在苹果这个事情take the apple是不是已经结束了?", "end": 214.6}, {"start": 214.6, "text": "所以关注最后两句。", "end": 216.6}, {"start": 221.6, "text": "苹果现在在哪里?", "end": 224.7}, {"start": 227.7, "text": "注意有一个运动叫做Squash.", "end": 230.7}, {"start": 230.7, "text": "Squash, 这个是苹果。", "end": 232.7}, {"start": 232.7, "text": "Squash, 是苹果。", "end": 234.7}, {"start": 234.7, "text": "Squash, 是苹果。", "end": 237.58}, {"start": 237.58, "text": "Squash, 是苹果。", "end": 240.21}, {"start": 240.21, "text": "Squash, 是苹果。", "end": 242.21}, {"start": 242.21, "text": "Squash, 是苹果。", "end": 244.77}, {"start": 244.77, "text": "in her basket", "end": 246.37}, {"start": 246.37, "text": "注意有一个运动叫什么", "end": 248.21}, {"start": 248.21, "text": "basket ball", "end": 249.61}, {"start": 249.61, "text": "球ball", "end": 251.01}, {"start": 251.01, "text": "篮子球篮球basket ball", "end": 254.05}, {"start": 254.05, "text": "这就叫篮子basket", "end": 255.69}, {"start": 255.69, "text": "当然这是一个装苹果的basket", "end": 258.41}, {"start": 258.41, "text": "经典的篮子", "end": 260.21}, {"start": 260.21, "text": "所以再看一遍", "end": 261.65}, {"start": 261.65, "text": "she put her hand up", "end": 263.53}