 apple", "end": 391.0}, {"start": 391.0, "text": "she put it in the basket", "end": 393.32}, {"start": 393.36, "text": "so after she took the apple", "end": 395.76}, {"start": 395.76, "text": "she put it in the basket", "end": 397.96}, {"start": 397.96, "text": "before是什么", "end": 399.44}, {"start": 399.44, "text": "拿在手里", "end": 400.48}, {"start": 400.48, "text": "之后是干嘛", "end": 401.52}, {"start": 401.52, "text": "in the basket", "end": 402.4}, {"start": 402.4, "text": "right", "end": 402.96}, {"start": 402.96, "text": "before after", "end": 404.84}, {"start": 404.84, "text": "所以after she took the apple", "end": 407.16}, {"start": 407.16, "text": "she put it in the basket", "end": 409.24}, {"start": 409.24, "text": "then she put her basket down", "end": 412.82}, {"start": 412.82, "text": "the apple was up on the tree", "end": 415.46}, {"start": 415.46, "text": "now it is down in the basket", "end": 418.54}, {"start": 418.54, "text": "the apple was in the tree", "end": 420.94}, {"start": 420.94, "text": "now it is in the basket", "end": 424.3}, {"start": 424.3, "text": "所以这里把is was再梳理一遍", "end": 426.58}, {"start": 426.58, "text": "对吧", "end": 427.14}, {"start": 427.14, "text": "now it is", "end": 428.58}, {"start": 428.58, "text": "before it was", "end": 431.26}, {"start": 431.26, "text": "好", "end": 432.26}, {"start": 432.26, "text": "所以好不容易把苹果摘下来放好了", "end": 436.14}, {"start": 436.14, "text": "这边反复说了几句话", "end": 438.5}, {"start": 438.5, "text": "其实四段话的内容是一样的", "end": 440.5}, {"start": 440.5, "text": "只是把之前之后一些动作帮大家梳理一遍", "end": 444.06}, {"start": 444.06, "text": "尤其是before跟after的运用", "end": 446.54}, {"start": 446.54, "text": "瑞杰老师这里帮大家总结一下", "end": 448.9}, {"start": 448.9, "text": "我们说一件事情在之前发生", "end": 451.18}, {"start": 451.18, "text": "我们就要说before", "end": 452.46}, {"start": 452.46, "text": "譬如说我举两个情况", "end": 454.86}, {"start": 454.86, "text": "如果我们说before I go to school", "end": 458.18}, {"start": 458.18, "text": "I eat breakfast", "end": 460.22}, {"start": 460.22, "text": "我们去上学前要干嘛", "end": 461.98}, {"start": 461.98, "text": "吃早餐", "end": 462.94}, {"start": 462.94, "text": "I eat breakfast is before I go to school", "end": 467.7}, {"start": 467.7, "text": "所以I go to school这件事情的之前是什么", "end": 471.18}, {"start": 471.18, "text": "吃早餐", "end": 472.42}, {"start": 472.42, "text": "这是一种情况", "end": 473.38}, {"start": 473.38, "text": "还有一种是空间上的", "end": 475.14}, {"start": 475.14, "text": "you are before me", "end": 477.94}, {"start": 477.94, "text": "你在我的之前跟前都可以讲before", "end": 481.82}, {"start": 481.82, "text": "它确实是一个方位", "end": 483.46}, {"start": 483.46, "text": "就是什么before", "end": 486.26}, {"start": 486.26, "text": "你到了我的跟前before", "end": 488.74}, {"start": 488.74, "text": "那反义词就是after", "end": 490.54}, {"start": 490.54, "text": "好", "end": 490.94}, {"start": 490.94, "text": "那我们把问句的结构再过一遍", "end": 493.06}, {"start": 493.06, "text": "那当然这个问句说的是什么", "end": 494.9}, {"start": 494.9, "text": "when就是什么时间概念", "end": 497.22}, {"start": 497.22, "text": "when", "end": 498.14}, {"start": 498.14, "text": "时间概念", "end": 499.3}, {"start": 499.3, "text": "对吧", "end": 499.9}, {"start": 499.9, "text": "when was the apple on the branch", "end": 502.82}, {"start": 502.82, "text": "注意第二个词是什么", "end": 505.1}, {"start": 505.1, "text": "问句的什么核心问点", "end": 507.9}, {"start": 507.9, "text": "第一个是问的对象", "end": 509.66}, {"start": 509.66, "text": "when什么时间", "end": 511.46}, {"start": 511.46, "text": "was存在状态", "end": 513.22}, {"start": 513.22, "text": "is was", "end": 514.86}, {"start": 514.86, "text": "when was它在什么时间", "end": 518.62}, {"start": 518.62, "text": "the apple on the branch", "end": 520.06}, {"start": 520.06, "text": "所以什么时间在", "end": 521.86}, {"start": 521.86, "text": "这个在就是问的什么核心内容", "end": 525.61}, {"start": 525.61, "text": "在与否", "end": 527.13}, {"start": 527.13, "text": "在不在", "end": 528.63}, {"start": 528.63, "text": "was", "end": 529.35}, {"start": 529.35, "text": "when was the apple on the branch", "end": 531.91}, {"start": 531.91, "text": "那注意不要再倒回中式思维了", "end": 535.07}, {"start": 535.07, "text": "中式思维你们会怎么说", "end": 536.95}, {"start": 536.95, "text": "the apple on the branch is when", "end": 540.82}, {"start": 540.82, "text": "有没有", "end": 541.34}, {"start": 541.34, "text": "苹果在树上是什么时候啊", "end": 543.38}, {"start": 543.38, "text": "right", "end": 543.78}, {"start": 543.78, "text": "这个is when", "end": 544.9}, {"start": 544.9, "text": "你就会这么去说", "end": 546.22}, {"start": 546.22, "text": "注意问句最重要的是问的点", "end": 548.94}, {"start": 548.94, "text": "而后是核心疑问", "end": 550.46}, {"start": 550.46, "text": "譬如核心立场啊", "end": 552.42}, {"start": 552.42, "text": "核心的这个动作", "end": 554.02}, {"start": 554.02, "text": "它会放第二", "end": 554.94}, {"start": 554.94, "text": "最后才是什么其他的细节", "end": 557.06}, {"start": 557.06, "text": "那相应的", "end": 558.06}, {"start": 558.06, "text": "when was it over her head", "end": 561.81}, {"start": 561.81, "text": "when was the apple over her head", "end": 566.56}, {"start": 566.56, "text": "it was on the branch before she took it", "end": 570.52}, {"start": 570.52, "text": "when was the apple on the branch", "end": 572.84}, {"start": 572.84, "text": "树枝 branch", "end": 574.48}, {"start": 574.48, "text": "it was on the branch before she took it", "end": 578.84}, {"start": 578.84, "text": "it was on the branch then", "end": 581.6}, {"start": 581.6, "text": "想起then了没有", "end": 583.4}, {"start": 583.4, "text": "now then", "end": 585.28}, {"start": 585.28, "text": "任何别的时间都叫做then", "end": 587.52}, {"start": 587.52, "text": "right", "end": 588.24}, {"start": 588.24, "text": "所以当时it was on the branch then", "end": 591.84}, {"start": 591.84, "text": "在树上", "end": 593.38}, {"start": 593.38, "text": "就是在前面这个时候", "end": 595.26}, {"start": 595.26, "text": "it was on the branch", "end": 596.5}, {"start": 596.5, "text": "所以这个then带指的是什么", "end": 599.66}, {"start": 599.66, "text": "苹果还在树上的时候", "end": 601.78}, {"start": 601.78, "text": "it was on the branch then", "end": 603.5}, {"start": 603.5, "text": "所以now跟then", "end": 604.82}, {"start": 604.82, "text": "既可以放巨手", "end": 606.06}, {"start": 606.06, "text": "也可以放巨尾", "end": 607.3}, {"start": 607.3, "text": "其实任何补充信息都是这样的", "end": 609.82}, {"start": 609.82, "text": "都可以去改变它的位置", "end": 612.18}, {"start": 612.18, "text": "看你的重心在哪里", "end": 613.66}, {"start": 613.66, "text": "when did she take it", "end": 615.42}, {"start": 615.42, "text": "when 什么时候", "end": 617.14}, {"start": 617.14, "text": "did 做了没有", "end": 618.82}, {"start": 618.82, "text": "或者做了与否", "end": 620.1}, {"start": 620.1, "text": "对吧", "end": 621.06}, {"start": 621.06, "text": "when did", "end": 622.1}, {"start": 622.1, "text": "那就是什么", "end": 622.86}, {"start": 622.86, "text": "什么时候做的", "end": 625.18}, {"start": 625.18, "text": "所以核心疑问就是什么", "end": 626.74}, {"start": 626.74, "text": "答的人核心的答的是什么", "end": 629.1}, {"start": 629.1, "text": "做这件事情来说", "end": 630.7}, {"start": 630.7, "text": "when", "end": 631.66}, {"start": 631.66, "text": "when did she take it", "end": 633.7}, {"start": 633.7, "text": "she take it就是做的内容", "end": 636.1}, {"start": 636.1, "text": "right", "end": 636.5}, {"start": 636.5, "text": "她拿走这件事情", "end": 638.34}, {"start": 638.34, "text": "什么时候做的", "end": 639.9}, {"start": 639.9, "text": "when did she take it", "end": 641.3}, {"start": 641.3, "text": "she took it after she put her hand up", "end": 644.22}, {"start": 644.22, "text": "肯定是先put her hand up", "end": 646.1}, {"start": 646.1, "text": "after 干嘛", "end": 647.22}, {"start": 647.22, "text": "take it down", "end": 648.3}, {"start": 648.3, "text": "she took it after she put her hand up", "end": 651.18}, {"start": 651.18, "text": "所以哪个在前哪个在后", "end": 653.7}, {"start": 653.7, "text": "是不是she put her hand up在前", "end": 657.02}, {"start": 657.02, "text": "因为after在这里", "end": 658.38}, {"start": 658.38, "text": "对吧", "end": 658.82}, {"start": 658.82, "text": "she took it在后", "end": 660.74}, {"start": 660.74, "text": "所以是干嘛", "end": 661.42}, {"start": 661.42, "text": "she put her hand up", "end": 662.74}, {"start": 662.74, "text": "and then she took it off", "end": 664.78}, {"start": 664.78, "text": "the apple of the tree", "end": 667.22}, {"start": 667.22, "text": "所以这个词是这样", "end": 668.5}, {"start": 668.5, "text": "she took it then", "end": 671.04}, {"start": 671.04, "text": "she took it after she put her hand up", "end": 676.35}, {"start": 676.35, "text": "she took it then", "end": 678.31}, {"start": 678.31, "text": "这个then的时间指的就是什么", "end": 681.27}, {"start": 681.27, "text": "after she put her hand up", "end": 682.67}, {"start": 682.67, "text": "所以时间性的东西", "end": 684.11}, {"start": 684.11, "text": "也可以用行为去描述", "end": 685.67}, {"start": 685.67, "text": "right", "end": 686.43}, {"start": 686.43, "text": "不总是说几点钟", "end": 687.91}, {"start": 687.91, "text": "你也可以说什么", "end": 688.75}, {"start": 688.75, "text": "当谁做了什么的时候", "end": 690.99}, {"start": 690.99, "text": "有没有", "end": 691.43}, {"start": 691.43, "text": "这个就是一个时间性了", "end": 692.91}, {"start": 692.91, "text": "也可以用when来指代", "end": 695.15}, {"start": 695.15, "text": "when did she put it in the basket", "end": 697.67}, {"start": 697.67, "text": "所以你们很会问问题的", "end": 699.23}, {"start": 699.23, "text": "现在when did对吧", "end": 700.99}, {"start": 700.99, "text": "什么时候做的", "end": 702.59}, {"start": 702.59, "text": "she put it in the basket这件事情", "end": 706.01}, {"start": 706.01, "text": "所以这是具体的事情", "end": 707.49}, {"start": 707.49, "text": "放最后", "end": 708.65}, {"start": 708.65, "text": "did这个核心疑问干嘛", "end": 710.57}, {"start": 710.57, "text": "放在前面", "end": 711.53}, {"start": 711.53, "text": "when did she put it in the basket", "end": 714.21}, {"start": 714.21, "text": "she put it in the basket", "end": 715.93}, {"start": 715.93, "text": "after she took it from the branch", "end": 718.85}, {"start": 718.85, "text": "什么时候放到篮子里的", "end": 720.77}, {"start": 720.81, "text": "在这个after she took it off the branch", "end": 723.73}, {"start": 723.73, "text": "在什么", "end": 724.49}, {"start": 724.49, "text": "take it off the branch之后", "end": 726.77}, {"start": 726.77, "text": "after", "end": 727.45}, {"start": 727.45, "text": "she had it in her hand", "end": 731.41}, {"start": 731.41, "text": "now she doesn't have it in her hand", "end": 734.31}, {"start": 734.31, "text": "she had it in her hand", "end": 736.63}, {"start": 736.63, "text": "after she took it from the branch", "end": 741.27}, {"start": 741.27, "text": "发生在什么", "end": 743.06}, {"start": 743.06, "text": "she had it in her hand之前", "end": 748.27}, {"start": 748.27, "text": "所以什么", "end": 748.75}, {"start": 748.75, "text": "she had it in her hand after she took it from the branch", "end": 751.87}, {"start": 751.87, "text": "and before she put it in the basket", "end": 758.1}, {"start": 758.1, "text": "所以这些事又发生在什么", "end": 759.94}, {"start": 759.94, "text": "put it in the basket之前", "end": 761.86}, {"start": 761.86, "text": "before", "end": 763.49}, {"start": 763.49, "text": "所以before after会串联句子的什么前后顺序", "end": 767.45}, {"start": 767.45, "text": "它是一个灵活的插件一样", "end": 769.65}, {"start": 769.65, "text": "所以如果这句话不用before after", "end": 771.89}, {"start": 771.89, "text": "first she took it from the branch", "end": 774.85}, {"start": 774.85, "text": "这是first第一步", "end": 776.57}, {"start": 776.57, "text": "second she had it in her hand", "end": 779.94}, {"start": 779.94, "text": "third she put it in the basket", "end": 782.14}, {"start": 782.14, "text": "也可以这么去讲", "end": 783.42}, {"start": 783.42, "text": "这就是为什么很多高中生", "end": 785.74}, {"start": 785.74, "text": "写高考作文的时候", "end": 787.14}, {"start": 787.14, "text": "总是会写什么", "end": 788.42}, {"start": 788.42, "text": "firstly secondly thirdly", "end": 791.14}, {"start": 791.14, "text": "他就是在套数字模板", "end": 793.22}, {"start": 793.22, "text": "避免要去串联语言", "end": 795.58}, {"start": 795.58, "text": "就是机械的编号数这个事件", "end": 798.74}, {"start": 798.74, "text": "这也是很多高中老师去安立的", "end": 801.02}, {"start": 801.02, "text": "因为什么", "end": 801.98}, {"start": 801.98, "text": "学生写作太差", "end": 803.54}, {"start": 803.54, "text": "如果不这么写", "end": 804.9}, {"start": 804.9, "text": "你真让他这样子去写", "end": 806.7}, {"start": 806.7, "text": "大家乱写", "end": 808.1}, {"start": 808.1, "text": "所以我一直说什么", "end": 809.02}, {"start": 809.02, "text": "瑞杰老师的基础课程干嘛", "end": 811.18}, {"start": 811.18, "text": "是适用于学生党的", "end": 813.14}, {"start": 813.14, "text": "你能这样子去描述事件的时候", "end": 816.06}, {"start": 816.06, "text": "你会发现你的语言活起来了", "end": 818.34}, {"start": 818.34, "text": "比较像人画", "end": 820.14}, {"start": 820.14, "text": "对吧", "end": 820.5}, {"start": 820.5, "text": "不像机器生成的表格", "end": 822.58}, {"start": 822.58, "text": "所以不要小看基本功", "end": 824.26}, {"start": 824.26, "text": "就是这个道理", "end": 825.1}, {"start": 825.1, "text": "刚刚before after", "end": 828.06}, {"start": 828.06, "text": "就是要练习一下才行", "end": 830.66}, {"start": 830.66, "text": "因为我知道你去推理去翻译的话", "end": 834.14}, {"start": 834.14, "text": "这些能折磨死你", "end": 836.06}, {"start": 836.06, "text": "你直接去看", "end": 837.54}, {"start": 837.54, "text": "先说了什么事情", "end": 839.46}, {"start": 839.46, "text": "然后after", "end": 840.78}, {"start": 840.78, "text": "或者after什么事情做了啥", "end": 843.5}, {"start": 843.5, "text": "你直接去看这些标记", "end": 845.66}, {"start": 845.66, "text": "就比较好理解了", "end": 847.26}, {"start": 847.26, "text": "用英语去理解英语更快", "end": 849.54}, {"start": 849.54, "text": "所以开始形成这种思维习惯", "end": 852.22}, {"start": 852.22, "text": "不要绕回汉语", "end": 853.38}, {"start": 853.38, "text": "然后在那里推理", "end": 854.46}, {"start": 854.46, "text": "甚至拿笔出来画", "end": 855.98}, {"start": 855.98, "text": "这个先", "end": 856.98}, {"start": 856.98, "text": "然后after是这个意思", "end": 859.02}, {"start": 859.02, "text": "然后再", "end": 859.66}, {"start": 859.66, "text": "有没有很多人这样子", "end": 860.86}, {"start": 860.86, "text": "白学了", "end": 861.78}, {"start": 861.78, "text": "是吧", "end": 862.22}, {"start": 862.22, "text": "来", "end": 862.98}, {"start": 862.98, "text": "我们通过练习干嘛", "end": 864.18}, {"start": 864.18, "text": "提高运用", "end": 865.62}, {"start": 865.62, "text": "形成语感", "end": 867.1}, {"start": 871.34, "text": "在两本书之间", "end": 875.09}, {"start": 875.09, "text": "这件事情是before还是after", "end": 883.84}, {"start": 883.84, "text": "那当然是before了", "end": 886.24}, {"start": 886.24, "text": "否则拿傻给John", "end": 887.6}, {"start": 887.6, "text": "对吧", "end": 888.12}, {"start": 888.12, "text": "你会用就行了", "end": 889.4}, {"start": 889.4, "text": "不要再去担心受伤", "end": 891.44}, {"start": 891.44, "text": "你会用就行了", "end": 892.72}, {"start": 892.72, "text": "不要再去担心受伤", "end": 894.72}, {"start": 894.72, "text": "你会用就行了", "end": 895.92}, {"start": 895.92, "text": "你会用就行了", "end": 896.92}, {"start": 896.92, "text": "你会用就行了", "end": 897.92}, {"start": 897.92, "text": "你会用就行了", "end": 898.92}, {"start": 898.92, "text": "你会用就行了", "end": 899.92}, {"start": 899.92, "text": "你会用就行了", "end": 900.92}, {"start": 900.92, "text": "你会用就行了", "end": 901.92}, {"start": 901.92, "text": "你会用就行了", "end": 902.92}, {"start": 902.92, "text": "你会用就行了", "end": 903.92}, {"start": 904.04, "text": "担心受怕了", "end": 905.68}, {"start": 905.68, "text": "会用就行", "end": 906.8}, {"start": 906.8, "text": "John put it on the shelf", "end": 908.28}, {"start": 908.28, "text": "这件事情", "end": 909.32}, {"start": 909.32, "text": "是after还是before", "end": 911.28}, {"start": 911.28, "text": "he got it from merry", "end": 913.36}, {"start": 913.36, "text": "那肯定是先从merry那里", "end": 915.24}, {"start": 915.24, "text": "拿到", "end": 915.84}, {"start": 915.84, "text": "对吧", "end": 916.48}, {"start": 916.48, "text": "所以是after he got it from merry", "end": 918.88}, {"start": 918.88, "text": "就是这件事在他之后", "end": 920.88}, {"start": 920.88, "text": "right", "end": 921.88}, {"start": 921.88, "text": "John put it on the shelf", "end": 923.44}, {"start": 923.44, "text": "after he got it from merry", "end": 926.16}, {"start": 926.16, "text": "来", "end": 927.2}, {"start": 927.2, "text": "换个语境", "end": 928.04}, {"start": 928.04, "text": "又回到Alice他们家去", "end": 930.12}, {"start": 930.12, "text": "我们不是有两家人吗", "end": 931.36}, {"start": 931.36, "text": "一个是MaryJohn", "end": 932.68}, {"start": 932.68, "text": "一個是Alice 他們", "end": 934.68}, {"start": 934.68, "text": "knives and forks and spoons", "end": 936.68}, {"start": 936.68, "text": "knives and forks and spoons", "end": 938.68}, {"start": 938.68, "text": "想起來吧", "end": 940.68}, {"start": 940.68, "text": "were in the drawer", "end": 943.37}, {"start": 943.37, "text": "Alice took these things out of the drawer", "end": 945.37}, {"start": 945.37, "text": "she put them on the table", "end": 947.37}, {"start": 947.37, "text": "她幹嘛 take them out", "end": 949.37}, {"start": 949.37, "text": "put them on the table", "end": 951.37}, {"start": 951.37, "text": "要就餐了嘛 right", "end": 953.37}, {"start": 953.37, "text": "then she went out of the room", "end": 955.37}, {"start": 955.37, "text": "Alice put knives and forks", "end": 958.12}, {"start": 958.12, "text": "and spoons on the table", "end": 960.12}, {"start": 960.12, "text": "after 還是 before", "end": 962.12}, {"start": 962.12, "text": "put them out of the drawer", "end": 964.68}, {"start": 964.68, "text": "那肯定是 take them out of the drawer 是第一步嘛", "end": 966.68}, {"start": 966.68, "text": "對吧 最後才是 put them on the table", "end": 968.68}, {"start": 968.68, "text": "所以是 after", "end": 970.68}, {"start": 970.68, "text": "she took them out of the drawer", "end": 972.68}, {"start": 972.68, "text": "對吧", "end": 975.14}, {"start": 975.14, "text": "我是不是要先拿起來再給你們", "end": 977.14}, {"start": 977.14, "text": "所以前面前後的順序", "end": 979.14}, {"start": 979.14, "text": "你去看兩個事件的關係", "end": 981.14}, {"start": 981.14, "text": "中間去插入一個", "end": 983.14}, {"start": 983.14, "text": "時間標記就好了", "end": 985.14}, {"start": 985.14, "text": "she put the knives and forks", "end": 988.02}, {"start": 988.02, "text": "and spoons on the table", "end": 990.02}, {"start": 990.02, "text": "什麼 she went out of the room", "end": 992.02}, {"start": 992.02, "text": "she put these things on the table", "end": 994.02}, {"start": 994.02, "text": "肯定是之前與什麼", "end": 996.02}, {"start": 996.02, "text": "she went out of the room", "end": 998.02}, {"start": 998.02, "text": "所以兩者的關係是", "end": 1000.02}, {"start": 1000.02, "text": "以前以後", "end": 1002.02}, {"start": 1002.02, "text": "中間插什麼 before", "end": 1004.02}, {"start": 1004.02, "text": "she put the knives, forks, and spoons on the table", "end": 1006.02}, {"start": 1006.02, "text": "before 什麼", "end": 1008.02}, {"start": 1008.02, "text": "she went out of the room", "end": 1010.02}, {"start": 1010.02, "text": "在 she went out of the room", "end": 1012.02}, {"start": 1012.02, "text": "之前", "end": 1014.02}, {"start": 1014.02, "text": "before she went out of the room", "end": 1016.02}, {"start": 1016.02, "text": "第三個小故事", "end": 1018.02}, {"start": 1018.02, "text": "你看我們最近幾個大故事", "end": 1020.02}, {"start": 1020.02, "text": "分成小文段來總結", "end": 1022.02}, {"start": 1022.02, "text": "挺好的 回顧一下", "end": 1024.02}, {"start": 1024.02, "text": "the apple is in Mary's hand", "end": 1026.02}, {"start": 1026.02, "text": "it was on the branch of the tree", "end": 1028.02}, {"start": 1028.02, "text": "when Mary saw it", "end": 1030.02}, {"start": 1030.02, "text": "she took it from the branch", "end": 1032.02}, {"start": 1032.02, "text": "the apple is in Mary's hand", "end": 1034.49}, {"start": 1034.49, "text": "it was in the branch of the tree", "end": 1036.49}, {"start": 1036.49, "text": "when Mary saw it", "end": 1038.49}, {"start": 1038.49, "text": "she took it from the branch", "end": 1041.08}, {"start": 1041.08, "text": "she took it", "end": 1043.08}, {"start": 1043.08, "text": "she will put it in the basket", "end": 1045.08}, {"start": 1045.08, "text": "which she put down under the tree", "end": 1047.08}, {"start": 1047.08, "text": "哪一個 basket", "end": 1049.08}, {"start": 1049.08, "text": "the one which she put down under the tree", "end": 1051.08}, {"start": 1051.08, "text": "which 是什麼", "end": 1053.08}, {"start": 1053.08, "text": "情境內的事物特質", "end": 1055.08}, {"start": 1055.08, "text": "which", "end": 1057.08}, {"start": 1057.08, "text": "譬如說這裡有兩隻鴨", "end": 1059.08}, {"start": 1059.08, "text": "我問你哪一隻鴨", "end": 1061.08}, {"start": 1061.08, "text": "是母鴨", "end": 1063.08}, {"start": 1063.08, "text": "which duck is the mother", "end": 1065.08}, {"start": 1065.08, "text": "是媽媽鴨", "end": 1067.08}, {"start": 1067.08, "text": "which one 是特質這兩隻之間", "end": 1069.08}, {"start": 1069.08, "text": "你要去選 which", "end": 1071.08}, {"start": 1071.08, "text": "which she put down under the tree", "end": 1073.08}, {"start": 1073.08, "text": "當然現在語言裡面", "end": 1075.08}, {"start": 1075.08, "text": "開始省略這個", "end": 1077.08}, {"start": 1077.08, "text": "所以有時候我們現代語都會說什麼", "end": 1079.08}, {"start": 1079.08, "text": "in the basket she put under the tree", "end": 1081.08}, {"start": 1081.08, "text": "就夠了", "end": 1083.08}, {"start": 1083.08, "text": "因為是唯一的你還去選什麼 which", "end": 1085.08}, {"start": 1085.08, "text": "你直接說那個", "end": 1087.08}, {"start": 1087.08, "text": "籃子就好了 對吧", "end": 1089.77}, {"start": 1089.77, "text": "當然如果很多籃子這個詞就會有意義", "end": 1091.77}, {"start": 1091.77, "text": "這個我們以後遇到再說", "end": 1093.77}, {"start": 1093.77, "text": "the apple which", "end": 1095.77}, {"start": 1095.77, "text": "什麼 was on the branch", "end": 1097.77}, {"start": 1097.77, "text": "is in Mary's hand", "end": 1099.77}, {"start": 1099.77, "text": "所以那個 apple", "end": 1101.77}, {"start": 1101.77, "text": "which was on the branch", "end": 1103.77}, {"start": 1103.77, "text": "the apple which was on the branch", "end": 1105.77}, {"start": 1105.77, "text": "就是那個", "end": 1108.3}, {"start": 1108.3, "text": "在 branch 上面的蘋果", "end": 1110.3}, {"start": 1110.3, "text": "特質那一個", "end": 1112.3}, {"start": 1112.3, "text": "所以這裡做了一個 which", "end": 1114.3}, {"start": 1114.3, "text": "which 就是特質", "end": 1116.79}, {"start": 1116.79, "text": "我們在疑問的時候有時候會有一個特質性", "end": 1118.79}, {"start": 1118.79, "text": "特質的事物就會用 which 來指代", "end": 1120.79}, {"start": 1120.79, "text": "the apple which was on the branch", "end": 1122.79}, {"start": 1122.79, "text": "is in Mary's hand", "end": 1126.28}, {"start": 1126.28, "text": "Mary took it from the branch", "end": 1128.28}, {"start": 1128.28, "text": "這件事", "end": 1130.28}, {"start": 1130.28, "text": "發生在什麼時候", "end": 1132.28}, {"start": 1132.28, "text": "when she saw it", "end": 1134.28}, {"start": 1134.28, "text": "是她看到的時候", "end": 1136.28}, {"start": 1136.28, "text": "所以後面 she saw it 這件事情", "end": 1138.28}, {"start": 1138.28, "text": "定義了什麼時間", "end": 1140.28}, {"start": 1140.28, "text": "when 就是時間的指代", "end": 1142.28}, {"start": 1142.28, "text": "Mary took it from the branch", "end": 1144.28}, {"start": 1144.28, "text": "這件事", "end": 1146.28}, {"start": 1146.28, "text": "when she saw it", "end": 1148.28}, {"start": 1148.28, "text": "發生在什麼 when she saw it", "end": 1150.28}, {"start": 1150.28, "text": "那當然把時間前置", "end": 1152.28}, {"start": 1152.28, "text": "可不可以 也行", "end": 1154.28}, {"start": 1154.28, "text": "你可以說什麼 when she saw it", "end": 1156.28}, {"start": 1156.28, "text": "Mary took the branch", "end": 1158.28}, {"start": 1158.28, "text": "或者 when Mary saw it", "end": 1160.28}, {"start": 1160.28, "text": "she took it from the branch", "end": 1162.28}, {"start": 1162.28, "text": "你也可以導裝過來 也是可以的", "end": 1164.28}, {"start": 1164.28, "text": "因為只要標記了 when", "end": 1166.28}, {"start": 1166.28, "text": "聽的人就知道時間", "end": 1168.28}, {"start": 1168.28, "text": "是 she saw it", "end": 1170.28}, {"start": 1170.28, "text": "然後什麼 行為", "end": 1172.28}, {"start": 1172.28, "text": "是 took it from the branch", "end": 1174.28}, {"start": 1174.28, "text": "所以問句如此 陳述句也如此", "end": 1176.28}, {"start": 1176.28, "text": "這些代詞是可以通用的", "end": 1178.28}, {"start": 1178.28, "text": "你們一般遇到都在問句裡", "end": 1180.28}, {"start": 1180.28, "text": "what why when who", "end": 1182.28}, {"start": 1182.28, "text": "對吧 他其實是", "end": 1184.28}, {"start": 1184.28, "text": "通用代詞 不一定是疑問時", "end": 1186.28}, {"start": 1186.28, "text": "才能用 那個男人是誰", "end": 1188.28}, {"start": 1188.28, "text": "who is that man", "end": 1190.74}, {"start": 1190.74, "text": "對吧 這個 who 就是", "end": 1193.43}, {"start": 1193.43, "text": "某個人的指代", "end": 1195.43}, {"start": 1195.43, "text": "不用去想語法 我們在運用的過程中", "end": 1197.43}, {"start": 1197.43, "text": "去感受他的運用", "end": 1199.43}, {"start": 1199.43, "text": "你們有沒有發現 你們的閱讀能力", "end": 1201.43}, {"start": 1201.43, "text": "已經開始上得很快了", "end": 1203.43}, {"start": 1203.43, "text": "已經開始達到很多初中生的", "end": 1205.43}, {"start": 1205.43, "text": "高中生的水平了", "end": 1207.43}, {"start": 1207.43, "text": "所以托靈機有多快", "end": 1209.43}, {"start": 1209.43, "text": "就是這麼快 當然我們運用頻率", "end": 1211.43}, {"start": 1211.43, "text": "要保持 接下來還有很多", "end": 1213.43}, {"start": 1213.43, "text": "課 所以這些還會", "end": 1215.43}, {"start": 1215.43, "text": "遇到很多 不用擔心", "end": 1217.43}, {"start": 1217.43, "text": "現在你剛剛好開始有感覺", "end": 1219.43}, {"start": 1219.43, "text": "那是對的", "end": 1221.43}, {"start": 1221.43, "text": "我們來做一個真實的實戰", "end": 1223.43}, {"start": 1223.43, "text": "去感受一下 我們目前學到的", "end": 1225.43}, {"start": 1225.43, "text": "知識能描述什麼事情", "end": 1227.43}, {"start": 1227.43, "text": "現在是橙子", "end": 1229.43}, {"start": 1229.43, "text": "成熟的季節", "end": 1231.43}, {"start": 1231.43, "text": "請描述去果園幫爺爺摘橙子的故事", "end": 1233.43}, {"start": 1233.43, "text": "首先橙子", "end": 1235.43}, {"start": 1235.43, "text": "橙子 orange", "end": 1237.43}, {"start": 1237.43, "text": "橘子的或者橙色的", "end": 1239.43}, {"start": 1239.43, "text": "所以它叫 orange", "end": 1241.43}, {"start": 1241.43, "text": "橙子的顏色也叫 orange", "end": 1243.43}, {"start": 1243.43, "text": "所以英語這個詞很通用", "end": 1245.43}, {"start": 1245.43, "text": "現在是 orange", "end": 1247.43}, {"start": 1247.43, "text": "the oranges are ripe", "end": 1249.43}, {"start": 1249.43, "text": "ripe就是成熟的意思", "end": 1251.43}, {"start": 1251.43, "text": "有沒有更簡單的說法", "end": 1253.43}, {"start": 1253.43, "text": "ready are good", "end": 1255.43}, {"start": 1255.43, "text": "也行 別人也知道你的意思", "end": 1257.43}, {"start": 1257.43, "text": "請描述你去摘橙子的過程", "end": 1259.43}, {"start": 1259.43, "text": "所以幾乎就是", "end": 1261.43}, {"start": 1261.43, "text": "複述這個小女孩", "end": 1263.43}, {"start": 1263.43, "text": "the girl去摘蘋果", "end": 1266.15}, {"start": 1266.15, "text": "there is an orange", "end": 1268.15}, {"start": 1268.15, "text": "on the branch", "end": 1271.29}, {"start": 1271.29, "text": "of the tree", "end": 1274.41}, {"start": 1274.41, "text": "我們先描述這個畫面", "end": 1276.41}, {"start": 1276.41, "text": "this is the tree", "end": 1279.38}, {"start": 1279.38, "text": "this is a branch", "end": 1281.38}, {"start": 1281.38, "text": "我這邊沒有橙色的顏色", "end": 1283.38}, {"start": 1283.38, "text": "所以我們就當這些是橘子", "end": 1285.38}, {"start": 1285.38, "text": "為了更形象", "end": 1287.38}, {"start": 1287.38, "text": "我把這個越畫越像蘋果", "end": 1289.38}, {"start": 1289.38, "text": "隨便吧", "end": 1291.82}, {"start": 1291.82, "text": "就當這些是小紅橙", "end": 1293.82}, {"start": 1293.82, "text": "雪橙 這個好一點嗎", "end": 1295.82}, {"start": 1295.82, "text": "雖然像檸檬", "end": 1297.82}, {"start": 1297.82, "text": "但是也能過吧", "end": 1299.82}, {"start": 1299.82, "text": "這些是橙子", "end": 1301.82}, {"start": 1301.82, "text": "忍一忍吧各位 我沒有更好的顏色可以用", "end": 1303.82}, {"start": 1303.82, "text": "there are oranges", "end": 1305.82}, {"start": 1305.82, "text": "on the branches", "end": 1307.82}, {"start": 1307.82, "text": "of the tree", "end": 1309.82}, {"start": 1309.82, "text": "對吧 這是branch", "end": 1311.82}, {"start": 1311.82, "text": "on the branches", "end": 1313.82}, {"start": 1313.82, "text": "of the tree", "end": 1316.82}, {"start": 1316.82, "text": "這個男神出現了", "end": 1318.82}, {"start": 1318.82, "text": "I put my hand", "end": 1320.82}, {"start": 1320.82, "text": "up", "end": 1323.67}, {"start": 1323.67, "text": "to take", "end": 1326.14}, {"start": 1326.14, "text": "an orange", "end": 1328.14}, {"start": 1328.14, "text": "the orange is", "end": 1331.11}, {"start": 1331.11, "text": "now", "end": 